# Conformance probe pack for malformed input on the `geojson` wire
# (spec/vector-format.md, "Malformed input"). Public. No kinds.
format  conformance-malformed-geojson
version 0.1.0
distribution public
source  "goat-transformers spec/engine-spec.md and spec/vector-format.md (synthetic probe format, no external standard)"
wire    geojson
field   uid       id               string
field   lat       geometry.lat     float
field   lon       geometry.lon     float
field   callsign  properties.name  string
